# Parent  a6e03a1ed2a63e16952ba0dbfe98fdae969e0945
Bug 2063939 - Fix signature not inserted in plaintext inline forward with signature below the quote. r=BenC

nsMsgCompose::ConvertAndLoadComposeWindow wraps a plaintext inline forward in
a <div class="moz-forward-container">. Since an empty <div> would be collected
by HTMLEditor::RemoveEmptyNodesIn, the div is inserted holding a placeholder
<br>, which is deleted again once the forwarded text has been inserted.

Bug 2019689 made HTMLEditor::HandleInsertText delete the unnecessary line break
following the insertion point before inserting, for the plaintext mail composer
among others. Our placeholder <br> is exactly that line break, so the editor now
removes it for us. The subsequent nsIEditor::deleteNode call then gets an
orphaned node, which EditorBase::DeleteNodeWithTransaction refuses via
HTMLEditUtils::IsRemovableNode with NS_ERROR_EDITOR_UNEXPECTED_DOM_TREE, and the
NS_ENSURE_SUCCESS returns before the bottom signature is inserted.

Only delete the placeholder if it is still in the tree. Note that dropping the
placeholder altogether is not an option: the div would then be removed as an
empty node, Selection::CollapseInLimiter would silently no-op on the detached
div, and the forwarded text would end up unwrapped in the body.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324680


